://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/comments/5112268357","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13786931?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saagarjha","id":13786931,"login":"saagarjha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzg2OTMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"> It seems difficult to statically know whether the code will have side effects or not though?\n\nthe op has a flag","created_at":"2026-07-29T04:55:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/triton-lang/triton/issues/11065#issuecomment-5113412152","id":5113412152,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/11065","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAWaHXs8AAAABMMh6OA","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":1,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/comments/5113412152/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-07-29T04:55:51Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/comments/5113412152","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24322263?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ThomasRaoux","id":24322263,"login":"ThomasRaoux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzIyMjYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThomasRaoux","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Describe the bug\n\ntl.inline_asm_elementwise runs once per replicated element, rather than once per logical element. Since Triton does not expose replication (intentionally), this makes it impossible to properly use the API for operations that have side effects. Here is an example:\n\n```python3\nimport torch\nimport triton\nimport triton.language as tl\n\nN = 32  # fewer elements than the 128 threads (num_warps=4) -> layout replicates 4x\n\n@triton.jit\ndef k(addr, N: tl.constexpr):\n    offs = tl.arange(0, N)\n    tl.inline_asm_elementwise(\n        \"red.global.add.u32 [$1], 1; mov.u32 $0, 0;\",  # +1 to cell, dummy result\n        \"=r,l\", [addr + offs.to(tl.int64) * 4],\n        dtype=tl.int32, is_pure=False, pack=1,\n    )\n\ncells = torch.zeros(N, dtype=torch.int32, device=\"cuda\")\nk[(1,)](cells, N=N, num_warps=4)\n\nassert (cells == 1).all()\n```\n\n### Environment details\n\nTriton: main\nGPU: GH200","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":6,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/11065/comments","created_at":"2026-07-27T23:24:13Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/11065/events","html_url":"https://github.com/triton-lang/triton/issues/11065","id":4993227287,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null,"id":125679820,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjU2Nzk4MjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/11065/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOAWaHXs8AAAABKZ6aFw","number":11065,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/11065/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/11065/timeline","title":"inline_asm_elementwise emits does not correctly handle replicated elements","type":null,"updated_at":"2026-07-29T04:55:51Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/11065","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13786931?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saagarjha","id":13786931,"login":"saagarjha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzg2OTMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saagarjha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github